  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, line \\(\\ell\\) has a slope of \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\) and an \\(x\\)-intercept of \\((-8, 0)\\). What is the \\(y\\)-coordinate of the \\(y\\)-intercept of line \\(\\ell\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "6"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Through \\((-8, 0)\\) with slope \\(\\frac{3}{4}\\): \\(y = \\frac{3}{4}(x + 8)\\).",
    "At \\(x = 0\\), \\(y = \\frac{3}{4}(8) = 6\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\nline = Rational(3, 4)*(x + 8)\nb = line.subs(x, 0)\nassert b == 6\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [b]",
